{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The witches are long gone. The blighted wasteland covered in mist they created remains. Build a colony of former familiars. Brave the toxic mists and maybe even restore the environment to what it once was.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD A CITY FOR CATS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735490/extras/fe8a8216fbe0a5fcbd5671b62be2aa3d.poster.avif?t=1767372230\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735490/extras/fe8a8216fbe0a5fcbd5671b62be2aa3d.webm?t=1767372230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735490/extras/fe8a8216fbe0a5fcbd5671b62be2aa3d.mp4?t=1767372230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the perfect city for industrious cats with magical jobs. Manage food, power, and resources to keep your city growing. Unlock new technologies, buildings, and production chains that improve their quality of life and help you restore the environment. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RESHAPE THE LAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735490/extras/1e30756f5f6fa55afc87368f5b3eb387.poster.avif?t=1767372230\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735490/extras/1e30756f5f6fa55afc87368f5b3eb387.webm?t=1767372230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735490/extras/1e30756f5f6fa55afc87368f5b3eb387.mp4?t=1767372230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the mists that cover this world, convert it into water, and pour it into ravines. Grow grass for your crops and to make your cats happy. Craft explosives to blast new ravines and make your own rivers wherever you'd like.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENDURE TOXIC GLOOM STORMS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735490/extras/6c27ac02f6648f1ec318e41d129355e0.poster.avif?t=1767372230\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735490/extras/6c27ac02f6648f1ec318e41d129355e0.webm?t=1767372230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735490/extras/6c27ac02f6648f1ec318e41d129355e0.mp4?t=1767372230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wasteland you find yourself in will occasionally remind that you're not welcome. Spores will rain down and spread amongst your city, spreading hazardous gloom creep. Gloom creep will kill your crops and make your cats sick if you're not prepared. Important note: this game does NOT contain cat death! Sick cats just can't work until they're healed by a cat cleric.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CLEAN THEIR LITTER BOX</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735490/extras/ff87122ca24bda9c0c83a0aa94d360fd.poster.avif?t=1767372230\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735490/extras/ff87122ca24bda9c0c83a0aa94d360fd.webm?t=1767372230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735490/extras/ff87122ca24bda9c0c83a0aa94d360fd.mp4?t=1767372230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cats will let you know if they're not happy. Keep them fed with a variety of food, grow them grass to play on, build them a scratching post, and, most importantly, keep their litter box clean.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc08 Build</strong> a city for cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>\ud83c\udfed\u00a0<strong>Manage</strong> resources like wood, food, and fuel with production chains to support your growing cat population.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd2c Research</strong> new buildings and technologies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcc8 Balance</strong> kitten birth rates, crop growth, cat happiness, research, and power production to grow your city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0a <strong>Reshape</strong>\u00a0and terraform the land. Fill in old ravines and make new ones with explosives. Fill them with water for your farms or ink for fuel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26c8\ufe0f Endure</strong> storms that will put a strain on your workers and your economy if you're unprepared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2699\ufe0f Customize</strong> your start with advanced settings. Adjust things like storm frequency, cat hunger rate, and workplace power draw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfd6\ufe0f Relax</strong> in a colorful and chill atmosphere without fear of punishment or failure. Your cats will not die if you accidentally run out of food. (But they will be very upset with you.)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Disclaimer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No AI or machine learning of any kind was used during any part of this game's development.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3735490?t=1767372230","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3735490?t=1767372230","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735490/094da45cca4809a9b509af2d52aafaf76ecf4b7e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767372230","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735490/094da45cca4809a9b509af2d52aafaf76ecf4b7e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767372230","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3788020,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The witches are long gone. The blighted wasteland covered in mist they created remains. Build a colony of former familiars. Brave the toxic mists and maybe even restore the environment to what it once was.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD A CITY FOR CATS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735490/extras/fe8a8216fbe0a5fcbd5671b62be2aa3d.poster.avif?t=1767372230\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735490/extras/fe8a8216fbe0a5fcbd5671b62be2aa3d.webm?t=1767372230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735490/extras/fe8a8216fbe0a5fcbd5671b62be2aa3d.mp4?t=1767372230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make the perfect city for industrious cats with magical jobs. Manage food, power, and resources to keep your city growing. Unlock new technologies, buildings, and production chains that improve their quality of life and help you restore the environment. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RESHAPE THE LAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735490/extras/1e3