mstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735490/extras/ff87122ca24bda9c0c83a0aa94d360fd.poster.avif?t=1767372230\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735490/extras/ff87122ca24bda9c0c83a0aa94d360fd.webm?t=1767372230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735490/extras/ff87122ca24bda9c0c83a0aa94d360fd.mp4?t=1767372230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cats will let you know if they're not happy. Keep them fed with a variety of food, grow them grass to play on, build them a scratching post, and, most importantly, keep their litter box clean.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc08 Build</strong> a city for cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>\ud83c\udfed\u00a0<strong>Manage</strong> resources like wood, food, and fuel with production chains to support your growing cat population.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd2c Research</strong> new buildings and technologies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcc8 Balance</strong> kitten birth rates, crop growth, cat happiness, research, and power production to grow your city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0a <strong>Reshape</strong>\u00a0and terraform the land. Fill in old ravines and make new ones with explosives. Fill them with water for your farms or ink for fuel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u26c8\ufe0f Endure</strong> storms that will put a strain on your workers and your economy if you're unprepared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2699\ufe0f Customize</strong> your start with advanced settings. Adjust things like storm frequency, cat hunger rate, and workplace power draw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfd6\ufe0f Relax</strong> in a colorful and chill atmosphere without fear of punishment or failure. Your cats will not die if you accidentally run out of food. (But they will be very upset with you.)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Disclaimer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No AI or machine learning of any kind was used during any part of this game's development.</p>","developers":["Jon Nielsen"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735490/5fcb07d144731e595f3f0daa1ebbd13bf7138df0/header.jpg?t=1767372230","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3735490/1109877621/359e0ea86c9c32bf2464453d7b1ceffe5eb674d1/1750430390/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747322646","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3735490/1109877621/359e0ea86c9c32bf2464453d7b1ceffe5eb674d1/1750430390/dash_h264.mpd?t=1747322646","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3735490/1109877621/359e0ea86c9c32bf2464453d7b1ceffe5eb674d1/1750430390/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1747322646","id":257137474,"name":"Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257137474/5403bcab1e723af8422ff94aba5da57083434ded/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747322646"}],"name":"Mistpaw Ravine","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad Core Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Jon Nielsen"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated"